<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1979] &apos;File size limit Exceeded&apos; when importing notes - even for small files</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1979</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&apos;File size limit Exceeded&apos; when importing notes - even for small files&lt;br/&gt;
This happens even for tiny files - a few Kb.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See screenshot.&lt;br/&gt;
From the screenshot &quot;JSON file size cannot exceed MB&quot;.&lt;br/&gt;
Notice there is no number between &quot;exceed&quot; and &quot;MB&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I had my ZEPPELIN_WEBSOCKET_MAX_TEXT_MESSAGE_SIZE commented out in zeppelin-env.sh&lt;br/&gt;
Uncommented now and set to &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;export ZEPPELIN_WEBSOCKET_MAX_TEXT_MESSAGE_SIZE=4096000
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;but still getting the same error message.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It now prevents us from importing any notebooks.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12848125/12848125_filesizelimit-zeppelin.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin 0.7.0 from ~11/28 master snapshot&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
